  "label": "Postcolonialism",
  "description": "A critical theoretical framework that examines the cultural, political, and economic effects of colonialism and its aftermath. Postcolonialism challenges dominant narratives and seeks to center the voices and experiences of colonized peoples, often critiquing attempts to erase or minimize colonial history. The meme implicitly references postcolonial discourse by contrasting the gesture of reconciliation with the dismissal of colonialism.",
